  "faqItems": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "question": "What is Neuro Builds?",
      "answer": "NeuroBuilds is an AI-Assisted PC build recommendation platform designed for budget-constrained, first-time builders. The pipeline applies deterministic compatibility rules to recommend components, validates hardware compatibility, and connects you with a thriving community of PC enthusiasts."
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "question": "Is there a free version?",
      "answer": "Yes! Our Starter plan is completely free and includes basic PC builder tools, limited component database, and community access. Upgrade to Pro or Enterprise for advanced features like AI recommendations and priority support."
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "question": "How does the AI recommendation work?",
      "answer": "Describe your budget, use case (gaming, streaming, editing), and preferences in plain language. The AI-Assisted Orchestration Pipeline parses your intent, applies budget-allocation ratios deterministically, and runs seven compatibility checks to produce guided component recommendations."
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "question": "Can I buy components through Neuro Builds?",
      "answer": "Yes! We have a secure peer-to-peer marketplace where you can buy, sell, and trade components with other users. You can also find direct purchase links to retailers for all recommended parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "question": "Is compatibility checking really automatic?",
      "answer": "Absolutely. Our system automatically verifies that all components work together—checking power supply compatibility, motherboard socket types, RAM speed, GPU cooling, case dimensions, and more. We catch issues before they become problems."
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "question": "Do you offer customer support?",
      "answer": "All plans include community support. Pro and Enterprise customers also get priority email support. We respond to questions within 24 hours and offer detailed guides, video tutorials, and live chat assistance."
    }
  ],
